Z||000008||Dave Gunsul||05-24-2001||08:39 PM||||There is no such thing as to much when it comes to power!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The Fiero's a versatile animal, there are many engine upgrades to chose from.<BR>Turbo/super charger,V8,northstar,cams,headers<BR>3.1 stroker,3.4,3800 super charged,etc.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||14
